WEBVTT

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:12.450
I never thought it would take two days
to get from Itabashi to Tsukijima.

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:16.910
Haruka...

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.250
According to the
Land Survey Section's report,

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:26.200
they have confirmed changes in Earth's
orbit and believe Aulyn to be the cause.

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:26.200
36 hours since the loss of Prometheus 3, Nubilum

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:29.200
The gravitational anomaly's influence
on the precession of the equinoxes

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:31.870
is beginning to make
our rotation grow unstable.

00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:36.410
I am unable to get in contact
with any of Mondenkind's branches

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:37.790
due to worldwide radio interference.

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:43.830
I've switched to our backup submarine
cable, but we keep losing our connection.

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:52.120
It would seem irrefutable that Aulyn has
begun to open since it absorbed Nubilum.

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:56.870
It's kind of quiet, isn't it?

00:00:57.410 --> 00:01:01.290
And here the world may
be coming to an end...

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:06.750
What if the world really was
destroyed 108 years ago and

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:09.410
we're just part of Aulyn's dream?

00:01:09.410 --> 00:01:10.620
That isn't funny.

00:01:10.910 --> 00:01:16.540
Even if that were true, we cannot merely
wait for this nightmare to come to an end.

00:01:16.950 --> 00:01:19.500
Currently verifying the structural
integrity of the basic frame.

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:21.910
As for the electronics and external parts,

00:01:21.910 --> 00:01:25.500
we anticipate roughly 70% of the
materials will need to be replaced.

00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:29.160
I see the workers here are
as energetic as ever.

00:01:29.160 --> 00:01:32.700
Yeah. They said it's easier
if they keep moving.

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:34.950
How is Hagiwara?

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:38.450
She's still unconscious, but they said
there's no need to worry.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:39.370
That's great.

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:42.790
In the end, I wasn't able to do anything.

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:46.330
I wasn't able to protect anyone.

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:55.370
I wonder what is going
to happen to us now...?

00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:00.830
Huh? What's this?

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:04.450
A data line opened up
between all of the iDOLs.

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:06.540
Nebula?

00:02:10.620 --> 00:02:11.700
Hey, look!

00:02:12.120 --> 00:02:12.750
What's that?

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:17.540
Hey, Amami! Isn't this...?

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:32.000
Final Episode
The Moon and the Penguin

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:31.620
Imber...

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:34.700
Emergency: Yes
No visitors!
See the receptionist
if you need something!

00:02:39.290 --> 00:02:42.870
-bilum... Nubilum!

00:02:44.910 --> 00:02:47.830
Is that right? So the chief truly did...

00:02:48.160 --> 00:02:49.250
Take this.

00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:51.950
I was unable to do anything for her.

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:53.790
I could not help Sis at all...

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:57.200
You have inherited the chief's will.

00:02:57.500 --> 00:03:00.950
You can only make amends
for past mistakes in the future.

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:03.500
Become strong.

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:04.750
I will.

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:09.450
There's just no freaking way!

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:12.250
But if you consolidate
all of the iDOLs' data...

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:13.870
Then double check-

00:03:13.870 --> 00:03:16.750
I see you have finished analyzing the data.

00:03:17.700 --> 00:03:18.950
Sir...

00:03:22.910 --> 00:03:28.660
Ultimately, the iDOLs are saying,
"Send us inside Aulyn."

00:03:28.870 --> 00:03:31.290
But doesn't that sound weird?

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:35.660
Wouldn't gathering all five of the cores
in one place release Aulyn?

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:38.830
Yes, that's right. But look at this.

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:45.540
By only absorbing Nubilum,
Aulyn has been thrown out of whack

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:47.540
and its activities have become unstable.

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:50.910
Its influence is growing larger with time.

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:53.250
And eventually, it will...

00:03:53.410 --> 00:03:56.750
...hit Earth strong enough
to destroy the planet.

00:03:57.200 --> 00:04:01.370
To prevent that, we must re-stabilize Aulyn.

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:07.000
They said we can do that by letting Aulyn
absorb the other four cores.

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:11.830
But even if that does temporarily stabilize it,

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:14.290
there won't be much point if it releases-

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:17.700
The iDOLs said that while stabilizing Aulyn,

00:04:17.700 --> 00:04:20.830
they will also use their power to destroy it.

00:04:20.910 --> 00:04:21.910
They'll destroy it?

00:04:21.910 --> 00:04:25.950
And then they will use their remaining
power to stabilize the atmosphere.

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:27.750
Now wait a sec!

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:29.910
What do you mean
by "their remaining power"?

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:34.950
The iDOLs are saying that they will sacrifice
themselves to protect our planet.

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:36.750
They can't!

00:04:37.870 --> 00:04:40.250
Is that...

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:45.410
Is that what the iDOLs- what Imber wants?

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:48.580
No! No!

00:04:48.580 --> 00:04:49.950
Where are you taking him?

00:04:49.950 --> 00:04:51.700
Give Tempestas back!

00:04:51.700 --> 00:04:53.040
Mami, calm down!

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:53.700
No! Give him back!

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:54.250
We're going to have Nebula
take Tempestas with him.
No! Give him back!

00:04:54.250 --> 00:04:56.910
We're going to have Nebula
take Tempestas with him.

00:04:57.580 --> 00:05:02.160
They want to deploy today, so there is
only so much we can do for them.

00:05:02.370 --> 00:05:05.120
Tempestas volunteered to go
of his own free will!

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:06.910
Then I'll go with him!

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:10.290
I'm going with Tempestas!

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:13.540
If you do that, you'll die too, Mami!

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:16.160
Are you okay with letting Tempestas die?!

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:19.160
That's...

00:05:19.450 --> 00:05:20.410
Ami, you moron!

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:21.250
Mami!
Ami, you moron!

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:24.410
It must be hard.

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:27.000
Ritsuko...

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:31.000
Are Hiem's preparations all taken care of?

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:33.160
He didn't take much preparation.

00:05:33.250 --> 00:05:36.000
All we're doing is launching the iDOLs
up to Aulyn without their pilots

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:38.620
and then leaving the rest up to them.

00:05:40.290 --> 00:05:44.410
Chikako and the others are doing
what they can down here, but...

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:48.080
Are you okay with letting
it go down like this?

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:52.370
Minase?

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:56.500
Hey, wait! My clothes!

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:58.200
Found it.

00:05:58.200 --> 00:05:59.250
Found it.
Izayoi

00:06:03.080 --> 00:06:06.410
I've lost a place to go home to.

00:06:10.910 --> 00:06:12.500
Huh? I could have sworn...

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:15.790
What? I'm sure something was-

00:06:19.950 --> 00:06:21.790
Y-Yayoi?!

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:23.660
I finally found you!

00:06:23.660 --> 00:06:24.660
Why are you here?

00:06:25.450 --> 00:06:28.830
Why ask, "Why?" Isn't it obvious?

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:32.200
It's because you were holding
back tears over the phone!

00:06:34.250 --> 00:06:36.160
That's the only reason?

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:39.200
Isn't that what it means to be best friends?

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:46.790
Huh? Haruka?

00:06:52.660 --> 00:06:54.950
You've done well, Haruka.

00:06:57.540 --> 00:07:00.540
Are you sure? Even if it means
you'll truly never see him again?

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:05.450
You should give him a proper farewell.

00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:10.410
Futami?

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:13.790
Makoto, that outfit...

00:07:13.790 --> 00:07:17.080
Y-yeah, Minase forced it on me.

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:19.040
Do I look funny?

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:20.790
No, you look great.

00:07:21.450 --> 00:07:22.540
Cool.

00:07:22.620 --> 00:07:24.540
Are you on your way to see Hiems?

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:26.620
Yeah. How about you?

00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:29.830
Yes. I am going to see Tempestas.

00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:33.830
I'm going, too.

00:07:35.370 --> 00:07:37.410
Well? Have you calmed down a bit?

00:07:37.410 --> 00:07:38.580
Yeah...

00:07:38.870 --> 00:07:42.200
But boy was I surprised!
How did you get this?

00:07:42.330 --> 00:07:46.620
On my way here,
I met a really nice taxi driver.

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:50.700
Well, it just goes to show
my popularity isn't a total lost cause.

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:55.200
Haruka, may I ask you something?

00:07:56.450 --> 00:07:59.370
Do you regret becoming an Idolmaster?

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:05.830
You're amazing, Yayoi.
It's like you read my mind!

00:08:07.330 --> 00:08:09.830
I'm not really sure right now.

00:08:09.830 --> 00:08:16.120
I simply did whatever I wanted
to do at that time, so...

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:17.790
Then isn't that okay?

00:08:18.250 --> 00:08:19.620
What do you mean?

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:23.040
Haruka, it means you're still
the "first penguin".

00:08:23.580 --> 00:08:26.120
It's not like you to dwell on the
consequences so much

00:08:26.120 --> 00:08:27.540
that you get stuck in the mud.

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:30.290
Do what you want! Isn't that good enough?

00:08:30.790 --> 00:08:32.250
This is you we're talking about.

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:33.290
Yayoi...

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:39.330
Thank you.

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:42.200
The organic parts have been fully polymerized.

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:44.000
Reset reinforcements for the degenerating
electric field to 300 to play it safe.
The organic parts have been fully polymerized.

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:46.200
Reset reinforcements for the degenerating
electric field to 300 to play it safe.
Anyone with wax, gather in front of Nebula!

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:46.790
Reset reinforcements for the degenerating
electric field to 300 to play it safe.
Be sure to check over everything!

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:48.790
Anyone who hasn't written their best wishes yet,
I'm going to shut the panel!

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:55.540
What gives? You're keeping me out
of the fun after all we've been through?

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:58.950
Up there! Once you're done,
you can be the first to leave!

00:08:59.000 --> 00:08:59.870
Okay!

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:02.120
We're just about done.

00:09:02.620 --> 00:09:05.000
I'll show you a Nebula that's perfect!

00:09:05.450 --> 00:09:09.200
Are you stupid or what?
He's going to break soon anyway.

00:09:10.370 --> 00:09:13.870
We couldn't work on him
if we had that attitude.

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:19.250
No matter what's in store for him, we will
send him out in the best possible condition.

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:21.500
That's all we can do for him.

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:25.160
All of us love our iDOLs.

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:28.870
Well? Pretty admirable, isn't it?

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:33.830
He's really just about done,
so go wait topside.

00:09:36.290 --> 00:09:38.450
What?! Forehead Sunshine?!

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:42.290
The cosplaying entertainer!
Why are you here?

00:09:42.290 --> 00:09:42.910
So are you also an Idolmaster?
What on Earth are their criteria-
The cosplaying entertainer!
Why are you here?

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:47.450
So are you also an Idolmaster?
What on Earth are their criteria-
Shut up! I'm the best pilot here!

00:09:47.450 --> 00:09:48.700
Shut up! I'm the best pilot here!

00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:49.660
Yayoi?

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:52.040
What are you doing here?

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:55.660
Ami Futami... times two?!

00:09:56.040 --> 00:09:57.870
It's okay. She isn't scary.

00:09:58.120 --> 00:09:58.950
That's a good penguin.

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:00.410
B-but why?!
That's a good penguin.

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:04.250
This feels so familiar!

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:07.290
Wh-what?!
You're in on this, too?! W-w-wait!

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:08.950
Wait! Hold your horses!

00:10:08.950 --> 00:10:10.120
Whoa! Whoa, there! Whoa!

00:10:10.120 --> 00:10:12.200
I love this fur!
Whoa! Whoa, there! Whoa!

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:15.660
No, wait! You're so cold!
You're going to break my beak!

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:17.620
It's so fluffy!
No, wait! You're so cold!
You're going to break my beak!

00:10:18.040 --> 00:10:19.120
Stop it!

00:10:26.870 --> 00:10:28.870
I've confirmed that the shaft is now open.

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:31.080
The gravity elevator is on.

00:10:31.410 --> 00:10:34.080
Channel No. 0, iDOL standby!

00:10:52.620 --> 00:10:53.410
They're huge!

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:55.830
Whatcha think? Everyone
worked hard on them, huh?

00:10:55.870 --> 00:10:57.950
Imber, your coloring...

00:10:58.370 --> 00:11:00.620
What do you think of this pink?

00:11:00.830 --> 00:11:02.120
Isn't it nice?

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:04.700
Imber is SUPER happy!

00:11:04.950 --> 00:11:06.790
We got it done in time!

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:08.910
Will this wash off...?

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:10.950
Guys...

00:11:11.120 --> 00:11:13.750
Wow, so this one is Haruka's?

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:17.290
Yep, he's my boyfriend.

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:20.700
Oh, he's your boyfriend...

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:22.160
Amami! Minase!

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:23.000
Uh-huh!

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:25.500
Your boyfriend?
By boyfriend did you mean-

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:28.370
Later, Yayoi! Bye-bye!

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:30.790
Amami, you're going dressed like that?

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:31.870
Haruka...
Amami, you're going dressed like that?

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:33.500
I'm wearing the other under this.

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:34.790
You are?

00:11:40.910 --> 00:11:43.200
All iDOLs, begin the activation sequence.

00:11:43.950 --> 00:11:45.250
Activation is proceeding smoothly!

00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:47.370
The aerial route is clear!

00:11:47.370 --> 00:11:49.160
After we verify that the Masters
have taken shelter,

00:11:49.160 --> 00:11:49.450
we will begin the launch sequence.

00:11:49.450 --> 00:11:51.450
So this is our last mission.
we will begin the launch sequence.

00:11:51.910 --> 00:11:54.950
The iDOLs have already entered
the launch sequence!

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:56.580
Have them abort immediately!

00:11:56.580 --> 00:11:57.870
If Imber...

00:11:57.870 --> 00:12:02.120
If Imber is going to risk his life
to protect our entire planet,

00:12:02.120 --> 00:12:06.200
I would like to risk my own life for him.

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:08.620
Miss Amami, you mean to-!

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:10.370
Is that okay, Imber?

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:13.200
I won't listen if you tell me no.

00:12:19.870 --> 00:12:21.250
Huh? They're launching already?

00:12:21.410 --> 00:12:22.620
Good luck!

00:12:22.620 --> 00:12:23.450
Hang in there!

00:12:23.790 --> 00:12:27.000
Huh? Did Haruka and
the others disembark?

00:12:27.160 --> 00:12:28.160
Those girls...

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:49.950
Tempestas...

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:52.160
He's gone...

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:55.950
Haruka...

00:13:01.910 --> 00:13:05.750
The electromagnetic interference caused
by Aulyn is still growing in scale.

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:08.580
Natural disasters caused by
abnormal weather are also increasing.

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:10.540
Thoroughly review the transmissions.

00:13:10.540 --> 00:13:11.790
Level 3 Facilities and below are to shut down!
