Y-yes, sir!
Just use the analog line!
Continue calling the orbit center in Woomera.

00:13:24.790 --> 00:13:26.500
Lady Luck had finally come my way.

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:31.000
The villain should act like a villain,
struggling clear until the end.

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:37.910
We've completely lost the data links
to all of the iDOL units.

00:13:40.830 --> 00:13:43.790
We should go outside ourselves.

00:13:47.540 --> 00:13:50.790
Aulyn is progressing faster
than we had anticipated.

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:54.540
Why bring that up now?
We've come all the way out here!

00:13:58.500 --> 00:13:59.620
Drops?!

00:14:00.830 --> 00:14:01.950
Why?

00:14:02.200 --> 00:14:05.620
Do you think Aulyn has
noticed our presence?

00:14:08.620 --> 00:14:09.830
Oh, no...

00:14:09.830 --> 00:14:13.160
So he won't let us through
without a fight, huh?

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:15.540
All of the Drops are bigger than Lemons.

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:17.200
The only thing behind us
is our defenseless Earth.

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:19.410
S.O.S. kikoeta
I've heard the S.O.S.

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:19.080
The only thing behind us
is our defenseless Earth.

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:21.790
Naturally, we're going to crush
each and every one of them!

00:14:19.410 --> 00:14:24.290
Yatto anata ni kikoeta?
Have you finally heard it?

00:14:22.120 --> 00:14:24.750
Right! That is our...

00:14:24.750 --> 00:14:27.290
...job as Idolmasters!

00:14:33.620 --> 00:14:35.450
Here we go, Nebula!

00:14:38.290 --> 00:14:40.250
Kakko kawaiku ne
In a cutesy way

00:14:38.290 --> 00:14:39.910
We're off, Hiems!

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:43.660
Fujun, junsui, dotchi no character?
Impure or pure, which character?

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:46.370
Onaji na no kashira
Maybe they're the same

00:14:46.370 --> 00:14:49.540
Love beat ga sokudo zenkai
The love beat is opened up full throttle

00:14:49.540 --> 00:14:54.870
Kizuita, kore wa tokubetsu na mission... Wakatta
